abstract: >-
  Evidence record for the Master's thesis "Textually Clean, Semantically
  Wrong: An Anatomy and Detection of Silent Merge Failures" (Universität
  Passau, 2026): the frozen measurement reports, the plans and
  pre-registrations, the annotation exports, the decision record, the
  claims ledger, the appendix items that left print, and a source snapshot
  of the merge driver and the comparison framework. Code is licensed under
  Apache-2.0; documents, reports and data under CC BY 4.0.
